/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:180:front.block.footer.agreement: Terms of use
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:409:front.agreement.title: Terms & Conditions
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:412:front.agreement.heading: "Hareruya Terms & Conditions"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:413:front.agreement.s1.title: "1. Scope of Application"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:414:front.agreement.s1.body: "These Terms of Service apply to all users (Users) of services provided by Hareruya, Inc. (we, us, or our). Users are obligated to comply with these Terms. All policies, notices, and announcements posted or communicated by Hareruya regarding services constitute part of these Terms. In the event that any notice contains provisions that conflict with or contradict these Terms, such notice shall take precedence."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:415:front.agreement.s2.title: "2. Use of Hareruya Services"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:416:front.agreement.s2.body: "When using Hareruya, Users are obligated to read and understand all provisions of these Terms before beginning use. When posting, commenting, or making inquiries, Users are obligated to confirm in advance that there are no issues with the method or content of the submission."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:417:front.agreement.s3.title: "3. Posts and Comments"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:418:front.agreement.s3.body: "Users may post and comment on the site in compliance with these Terms. However, Users bear full responsibility for any content they post or comment on Hareruya services, and we assume no responsibility for such content. If a dispute arises between a User and a third party as a result of using Hareruya, the User shall resolve all such disputes at their own responsibility and expense, and shall not cause any inconvenience or damage to this site. If a User violates these Terms and causes damage to us, we may claim compensation from that User."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:419:front.agreement.s4.title: "4. Intellectual Property Rights"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:420:front.agreement.s4.body1: "Regarding the copyright of content displayed on Hareruya through User submissions, at the time a post reaches our servers, the User grants us a non-exclusive, royalty-free license (including the right to sub-license) to use such post domestically and internationally (including reproduction, public transmission, disclosure, distribution, transfer, lending, translation, adaptation, and editing). Users also agree not to exercise moral rights over their posts. Users may not copy or use the posts of other Users beyond the scope permitted by these Terms, and may not copy or use any content for purposes other than use on Hareruya. Furthermore, Users may not reproduce, distribute, transmit, or upload such content to other websites for the purpose of providing it to third parties."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:421:front.agreement.s4.body2: "Websites linked from the Hareruya site are operated by other operators. Please use the content of each website at your own responsibility. We cannot be held responsible for any content on such sites."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:422:front.agreement.s4.body3: "Magic: The Gathering is a registered trademark of Wizards of the Coast, LLC. Please contact Wizards of the Coast, LLC regarding their logos, symbols, all card content, and all rights related to Magic: The Gathering. All decklists are posted with permission from the respective websites. This site is not an official site operated by Wizards of the Coast, LLC. All other rights are held by Hareruya, Inc."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:423:front.agreement.s5.title: "5. Personal Information"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:424:front.agreement.s5.body1: "Hareruya may request personal information from Users for user verification and service improvement purposes."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:425:front.agreement.s5.body2: "Personal information provided to us will be used, protected, and managed in accordance with the Act on the Protection of Personal Information and our separately established Privacy Policy."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:426:front.agreement.s6.title: "6. Prohibited Conduct"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:427:front.agreement.s6.intro: "In addition to other prohibitions stated in these Terms, Users are prohibited from the following conduct:"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:428:front.agreement.s6.li1: "Knowingly transmitting false information"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:429:front.agreement.s6.li2: "Posting or commenting for solicitation purposes"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:430:front.agreement.s6.li3: "Intentionally transmitting the same information multiple times to assert oneself or harm others"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:431:front.agreement.s6.li4: "Conduct contrary to public order and morals"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:432:front.agreement.s6.li5: "Conduct linked to criminal activities"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:433:front.agreement.s6.li6: "Infringement of the intellectual property rights, property, reputation, or privacy of other Users or third parties"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:434:front.agreement.s6.li7: "Conduct that disadvantages other Users or third parties"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:435:front.agreement.s6.li8: "Defamation or slander of other Users or third parties"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:436:front.agreement.s6.li9: "Pre-election campaigning, election campaigning, or similar activities, and activities that violate the Public Offices Election Act"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:437:front.agreement.s6.li10: "Conduct deemed to have a negative influence on minors"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:438:front.agreement.s6.li11: "Conduct that interferes with Hareruya operations or damages our reputation"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:439:front.agreement.s6.li12: "Transmission of harmful computer programs such as computer viruses"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:440:front.agreement.s6.li13: "Unauthorized reproduction or redistribution of content from our emails or website"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:441:front.agreement.s6.li14: "Conduct that violates laws"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:442:front.agreement.s6.li15: "Any other conduct we deem inappropriate"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:443:front.agreement.s6.outro: "If a User engages in any of the above prohibited conduct, or if we determine that there is a high likelihood that a User will do so, we may temporarily suspend some or all of that User's rights. In this case, we shall bear no responsibility for any damage suffered by that User as a result of the suspension."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:444:front.agreement.s7.title: "7. Content Removal"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:445:front.agreement.s7.intro: "We may delete content, images, video, audio, or other digital data posted or uploaded by Users to Hareruya in the following cases, without notifying the User. However, this does not mean that we assume an obligation to monitor all User activities."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:446:front.agreement.s7.li1: "When we determine that the posted content falls under Prohibited Conduct in these Terms, or violates other provisions of these Terms"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:447:front.agreement.s7.li2: "When we determine that the posted content has become garbled and cannot be read by general Users"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:448:front.agreement.s7.li3: "When the same content has been posted repeatedly"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:449:front.agreement.s7.li4: "When the speed of displaying content on Hareruya has significantly slowed or is likely to slow, or when we determine that it places a significant burden on our servers"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:450:front.agreement.s7.li5: "When we receive a request for deletion from another User or a third party with appropriate reason and grounds"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:451:front.agreement.s8.title: "8. Disclaimer"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:452:front.agreement.s8.body1: "We may modify and correct portions of User posts or comments that we deem inappropriate at our discretion."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:453:front.agreement.s8.body2: "We have the right to investigate User posts and comments but are not obligated to do so."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:454:front.agreement.s8.body3: "If connection to Hareruya is difficult or impossible, or if some or all services are incomplete or not fully provided, or if User content is partially or completely lost due to communication infrastructure failures or system malfunctions, we bear no responsibility for such events. Users who can connect to this site shall not hold us responsible for any such malfunctions."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:455:front.agreement.s8.body4: "For in-store purchase assessment requests made at Hareruya, items for which a customer fails to collect within one month after our notification without a valid reason shall be deemed abandoned by the customer, and ownership shall be transferred to us at no cost."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:456:front.agreement.s8.body5: "If a dispute arises regarding our services and we receive a claim from a User or third party, and a court orders payment of damages or other liability, we may seek reimbursement of all costs related to that dispute (including damages, court costs, and attorney fees) from the User who caused the dispute."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:457:front.agreement.s9.title: "9. System Changes, Service Changes, Suspension, and Termination"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:458:front.agreement.s9.intro: "We may change the user interface, system, or service content of Hareruya without prior notice to Users. We may temporarily suspend all or part of the services in any of the following situations. We will endeavor to notify Users on Hareruya in advance where possible, but in cases of urgent necessity, we may suspend services without prior notice."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:459:front.agreement.s9.li1: "When maintenance of service equipment or systems is necessary"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:460:front.agreement.s9.li2: "When services cannot be provided due to social infrastructure failures such as power outages or fires"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:461:front.agreement.s9.li3: "When services cannot be provided due to force majeure events such as natural disasters, war, or riots"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:462:front.agreement.s9.li4: "When services cannot be provided due to measures based on laws and regulations"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:463:front.agreement.s9.li5: "When we determine that service interruption is necessary for other operational or technical reasons"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:464:front.agreement.s9.outro: "We may, at our discretion and regardless of reason, terminate part of Hareruya services or Hareruya operations. In such cases, we will notify Users on Hareruya at least 30 days before the planned termination date. After termination of Hareruya operations, we may, at our discretion, delete posts, comments, messages, and other content stored on our servers. We bear no responsibility for damages suffered by Users due to service changes, interruption, or termination based on this section."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:465:front.agreement.s10.title: "10. Revision of Terms"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:466:front.agreement.s10.body: "We may revise or modify these Terms without prior notice or notification to Users. Such revisions take effect by posting the new Terms on this page."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:467:front.agreement.s11.title: "11. Governing Law and Jurisdiction"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:468:front.agreement.s11.body: "These Terms shall be governed by the laws of Japan. For any disputes arising between us and Users, the court with jurisdiction over our place of business shall have exclusive jurisdiction as the court of first instance."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:469:front.agreement.established: "Established: April 22, 2015"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:492:front.privacy.s9.li2: "When entrusting the handling of personal information to contracted companies with confidentiality agreements, within the scope necessary to achieve the stated purposes of use (e.g., contracted companies include delivery companies, printing companies for catalog address labels, credit card companies when card payment is requested, etc.)"
